window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Being Hell’s only female Hellhound Shifter isn’t all it’s cracked up to be.</p> <p>When I’m hit with a Hellish curse that will change my life forever, my friends and I are caught up in a perilous situation that I can’t control. Or can I?</p> <p>As I wade through the proverbial Minotaur’s Labyrinth to escape, I try to figure out who is behind it. In a surprising twist, friends turn to enemies, and some to lovers. But it’s the end result that shocks me the most.</p> <p>My mother, the Devil, reveals my true destiny, and it’s one that I’m really unsure about. My sister is supposed to be the one with the hotshot future, not me. Yet, here I am....</p> <p>As my circle of lovers grows to include a variety of Hell-ish Monsters, I’m left breathless as I figure out what being Hell’s Guardian is all about, not to mention having a handful of mates to keep happy. Party time is over for this Hellhound, and now it’s time to step up.</p> <p>The first 12 chapters were published as a short story in the Into the Dark Anthology. These have been fleshed out and altered to include more depth and detail. This is now a full-length novel. Contains triggering situations. Includes scenes of M/M.</p>"; 
